cff-version: 1.2.0
title: MarsGIS
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: AARON R
    affiliation: "DIGITAL UNIVERSITY KERALA"
  - given-names: RADHAKRISHNAN T
    affiliation: "DIGITAL UNIVERSITY KERALA"
abstract: >-
  MarsGIS is an interactive Mars map/dashboard (a CesiumJS 3D Mars globe) with an
  integrated hyperspectral analysis engine that runs the Spectral Angle Mapper
  (SAM) on CRISM MTRDR cubes. Results are candidate spectral matches and are
  never presented as confirmed mineral deposits. NASA source data is fetched via
  services at runtime and is not redistributed.
keywords:
  - Mars
  - GIS
  - CesiumJS
  - hyperspectral
  - CRISM
  - Spectral Angle Mapper
  - Nili Fossae
  - planetary science
license: MIT
